      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Flabébé is one of the smallest Pokémon there is, just 10 cm tall and 0.1 kg, and it spends its whole life with a single flower. Right after it's born it searches for the bloom of exactly the shape and colour it likes, then rides it and tends it forever, so closely that the flower is thought to be part of its body. It's the only Pokémon with an accent in its English name.",
        "guide": "Flabébé is a Fairy-type Pokémon from Kalos and one of the smallest Pokémon of all. Each one rides a flower it chooses at birth and cares for it for life, drawing power from it; the flower can be red, yellow, orange, blue or white, and the White Flower is rare. All Flabébé are female.",
        "tagline": "A tiny fairy who picks one flower and keeps it for life",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Flabébé (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Flab%C3%A9b%C3%A9_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
        ]
      },
