          "description": {
            "fun": "AZ's Floette, over 3,000 years old since the machine that became the ultimate weapon brought it back to life, holds a flower that no longer grows anywhere, and it can't evolve. It sat in the game data from X and Y onwards, but its form name was only revealed in 2025 and it first became obtainable in Legends: Z-A.",
