          },
          "description": {
            "fun": "Only AZ's Eternal Flower Floette can Mega Evolve, making it the only Pokémon that isn't fully evolved with a Mega Evolution. Its flower doubles in size and soaks up so much Mega energy that it grows a will of its own and attacks by itself; at 20 cm, it's the smallest Mega of all.",
